.TH HD-SCREENSAVER 7 "October 2026" "hd-desktop" "HyprDebian"
.SH NAME
hd-screensaver \- the screensaver of the HyprDebian desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hd-launch-screensaver
.br
.B hd-kill-screensaver
.SH DESCRIPTION
The package
.B hd-desktop
holds the screensaver of the HyprDebian desktop, see
.BR hd-desktop (7).
It shows a text with random effects of terminal text effects
.RB ( tte )
in a full screen kitty window on every monitor.
.PP
The key
.B hd-screensaver
of the configuration can name another screensaver in its place, such as
.B hd-pipes
of the package
.BR hd-screensavers ,
see
.BR hd-pipes (6)
and
.BR "THE KEY" .
.PP
hypridle starts it after 2 minutes without input, and stops it before it
locks the screen with hyprlock, by
.IR ~/.config/hypr/hypridle.conf .
It also stops on a key press, or when another window gets the focus.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B hd-launch-screensaver
Start the screensaver that the key names, unless it already runs.
Without the key, when that program is not installed, or when it fails at
its start, by ending with an error within 2 seconds, it starts the text screensaver on every monitor, unless it
already runs.
It runs Hyprland's
.B hyprctl
and must run in the Hyprland session.
.TP
.B hd-cmd-screensaver
Show the text in a loop of random effects.
.B hd-launch-screensaver
runs it in each kitty window of the class
.BR hyprdebian.screensaver .
.TP
.B hd-kill-screensaver
Stop the screensaver that the key names, with SIGTERM, and the text
screensaver on every monitor.
.SH THE KEY
The key
.B hd-screensaver
is a string, the name of a screensaver: a program in the
.B PATH
of letters, digits,
.B \-
and
.BR _ ,
which is started without arguments, covers every monitor, ends on input
and ends on SIGTERM.
It is read in the configuration of the user,
.IR ~/.config/hyprdebian/config.json ,
first and, when that does not have it, in the configuration of the system,
.IR /etc/hyprdebian/config.json ,
see
.BR hd-config (7).
.PP
The package
.B hd-screensavers
sets the key of the system to
.B hd-pipes
when it is installed and the system has no key yet, and removes it when it
is removed and the key still is
.BR hd-pipes .
A user who wants the text screensaver while the system has another sets a
name that is not installed:
.PP
.RS
.nf
hd-config-update hd-screensaver '"none"'
.fi
.RE
.PP
A user follows the screensaver of the system again with
.PP
.RS
.nf
hd-config-remove hd-screensaver
.fi
.RE
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/hyprdebian/config.json
The configuration of the user, with the key
.BR hd-screensaver .
.TP
.I /etc/hyprdebian/config.json
The configuration of the system, with the key
.BR hd-screensaver .
.TP
.I ~/.config/hyprdebian/screensaver.txt
The text that the screensaver shows, when the user has one.
.TP
.I /usr/share/hd-screensaver/screensaver.txt
The text that the screensaver shows otherwise.
Copy it to
.I ~/.config/hyprdebian/screensaver.txt
to change it.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR hd-desktop (7),
.BR hd-config (7),
.BR hd-pipes (6),
.BR hypridle (1)
